        rdfs:label      "Reverse Transcription Quantitative PCR"@en-US ;
        ncit:C42610     "RT-qPCR"@en-US ;
        dc:description  "A method in which amplification of a specific RNA/cDNA sequence by a reverse transcription polymerase chain reaction is monitored by detection of fluorescent probes or intercalating dyes that indicate the (absolute or relative) amount of product being produced in real time."@en-US .

<https://vhp4safety.github.io/glossary#Q4734>
