        dc:description  "A process flow step that is named after exposure assessment and categorizes services that evaluate and analyze the route, duration, magnitude and frequency of exposure of an organism or (sub)population to one or multiple chemicals."@en-US ;
        dct:relation    <https://vhp4safety.github.io/glossary#VHP0000104> .

<https://vhp4safety.github.io/glossary#VHP0000420>
