        rdfs:label      "Blood-to-Plasma Ratio"@en-US ;
        ncit:C42610     "BPR"@en-US ;
        dc:description  "The ratio of the concentration of molecule in whole blood (i.e. contains both red blood cells and plasma) to the concentration of molecule in plasma, namely CB/CP."@en-US .

